UID:0Hw3rtQh0QyRrM2Ew5CJR
SUMMARY:Zoo Open Mic : All Genre Open Mic
DTSTAMP:20260824T033958Z
DTSTART:20260824T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:This is an open invitation to share your words\, sounds\, or pe
	rformances. Whether you bring poetry\, music\, or performance art\, we wel
	come what is passionate\, heartfelt\, and experimental. Together we’ll con
	tinue the legacy of Notsuoh as a space where creative energy is nurtured\,
	 community is built\, and experimentation is ALIVE & KICKING! Come to perf
	orm\, or come to listen and be part of the community (or come take picture
	s! We love our photographers!) .\n\nhttps://www.notsuoh.com/events/zoo-ope
	n-mic-20260629-tmgrw-wwfng\n\nFrom Notsuoh
URL:https://www.notsuoh.com/events/zoo-open-mic-20260629-tmgrw-wwfng
GEO:29.7603;-95.3866
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:notsuoh
CATEGORIES:Notsuoh
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
