 /2026/08/Olivia-Dean-in-Concert-at-Toyota-Center-1.jpeg
UID:hrswJR43NYaj3PfjLYDQz
SUMMARY: Olivia Dean in Concert at Toyota Center
DTSTAMP:20260824T033958Z
DTSTART:20260825T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes Olivia Dean—multi-BRIT Award\, Mercury P
	rize\, and Grammy nominee—and her The Art of Loving Live Tour with special
	 guest Baby Rose to Downtown’s arena stage. \nThe tour supports her highly
	 anticipated album\, The Art of Loving.  \nAdmission\nTickets start at $53
	. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was spons
	ored by the event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and mo
	re details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, busin
	ess\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.
	com/calendar/olivia-dean-in-concert-at-toyota-center/\n\nFrom 365 Things t
	o Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/olivia-dean-in-concert-at-toyot
	a-center/
LOCATION:Toyota Center\, 1510 Polk St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
