UID:ULmgH7nt7pBJnli1InpqG
SUMMARY:Comedian Jay Pharoah at Houston Improv
DTSTAMP:20260824T033958Z
DTSTART:20260830T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston Improv welcomes comedian\, actor and impressionist Jay 
	Pharoah for 5 stand-up shows over 3 nights. \nBest known for his spot-on i
	mpressions\, Pharoah spent six seasons as a cast member on NBC’s Saturday 
	Night Live. \nIn 2017\, he shifted to his first leading role as Floyd Moon
	ey in Showtime’s White Famous\, which was executive produced by Oscar-winn
	er Jaime Foxx and inspired by Foxx’s real-life experiences. \nAdmission\nT
	ickets start at $37. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calen
	dar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calend
	ar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\,
	 organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps:
	//365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/comedian-jay-pharoah-at-houston-improv-2
	026-5/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/comedian-jay-pharoah-at-houston
	-improv-2026-5/
LOCATION:Houston Improv\, 7620 Katy Fwy\, #455\, Houston\, TX\, 77024\, Uni
	ted States
