UID:dRYLbljNp4tlqEr3E0Fn-
SUMMARY:Curatorial Exhibition Tour: In the Between and Two Weeks of Winter
DTSTAMP:20260824T033958Z
DTSTART:20261024T153000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday\, October 24 starting at 10:30 AM for a curato
	rial walkthrough of HCP’s 2026 Fall Exhibitions currently on view: In the 
	Between\, and Two Weeks of Winter by Lindsay Sparagana\, led by Anne Leigh
	ton Massoni\, HCP Executive Director and Curator. RSVP is required via thi
	s link.\n\nhttps://www.edu.hcponline.org/events/261024-curatorial-tour-fal
	l-exhibitions\n\nFrom Houston Center for Photography
URL:https://www.edu.hcponline.org/events/261024-curatorial-tour-fall-exhibi
	tions
